{"strongs": "H3847", "word": "לָבֵשׁ", "translit": "la.vash", "root": "לבה", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "put on", "definition": "לָבֵשׁ לָבַשׁ verb put on (a garment), wear, clothe, be clothed (Late Hebrew id. ; Aramaic לָבֵישׁ , Assyrian labâšu ; Arabic ; Ethiopic ); — Qal Perfect 3 masculine singular לָבֵשׁ Ps 93:1 (twice in verse), לָבַשׁ Job 7:5 + 2 t., וְלָבַשׁ (consecutive) Lev 6:3 + 3 t.; suffix וּלְבָשֵׁם (consecutive) Lev 16:4 3 feminine singular לָֽבְשָׁה Judg 6:34 + 2 t., etc. ( Ezek 42:14 read probably וְלָֽבְשׁוּ Qr , for ילבשׁו Kt , but clause perhaps interpolated, see Co ); Imperfect 3 masculine singular יִלְבַּשׁ Deut 22:5 +; suffix וַיִּלְבָּשֵׁנִי Job 29:14 יִלְבָּשָׁם Exod 29:30 1 singular suffix אֶלְבָּשֶׁ֑נָּה Song 5:3 3 feminine plural תִּלְבַּשְׁןָ 2Sam 13:18 , etc.; Imperative masculine singular לְבַשׁ 1Kgs 22:30 , etc.; Infinitive absolute לָבוֺשׁ Hag 1:6 construct לִלְבּשׁ Gen 28:20 ; Lev 21:10 Participle active plural הַלֹּבְשִׁים Zeph 1:8 passive absolute לָבוּשׁ 1Sam 17:5 ; Dan 10:5 לָבֻשׁ Ezek 9:2 + 3 t.; construct לְבוּשׁ Dan 12:6 ; Dan 12:7 , לְבֻשׁ Ezek 9:11 + 3 t.; plural construct לְבֻשֵׁי Ezek 23:6 + 2 t.; — 1. a. literally put on (one's own) garment (accusative) Gen 38:19 ; 1Sam 28:8 ; 2Sam 14:2 ; 1Kgs 22:30 = 2Chr 18:29 ; Exod 29:30 ; Lev 6:3 ; Lev 6:4 ; Lev 16:4 (twice in verse); Lev 16:23 ; Lev 16:24 ; Lev 16:32 ; Lev 21:10 ; Deut 22:5 ; Ezek 44:17 ; Ezek 44:19 , and so Ezek 42:14 Qr (see above), Jonah 3:5 ; Song 5:3 ; Esth 4:1 ; Esth 5:1 with accusative garment + עַלבְּֿשָׂרוֺ Lev 16:3 of putting on armour Jer 46:4 = wear (more or less habitually), with accusative of garment, Isa 4:1 ; Deut 22:11 ; Zeph 1:8 ; Zech 13:4 of Jerusalem under figure of woman Jer 4:30 , of rulers under figure of shepherds Ezek 34:3 , compare כֵּן תִּלְבַּשְׁןָ 2Sam 13:18 (no accusative) \\ \\ b. very often figurative, put on, be clothed with , with accusative of garment; — לָבַשׁ בְּשָׂרִי רִמָּה Job 7:5 my flesh is clothed (i.e. covered) with worms ; of Jerusalem, be clothed with inhabitants Isa 49:18 of pasture, with flocks Ps 65:14 more often the garment is some abstract quality, e.g. righteousness, majesty, beauty, strength, etc.; — וַיִּלְבַּשׁ צְדָקָה כַּשִּׁרְיָן Isa 59:17 he ( ׳ י ) hath put on righteousness as a breastplate , compare v Isa 59:17 (vengeance), Ps 93:1 (majesty), v Ps 93:1 (strength), Ps 104:1 (honour and majesty), Isa 51:9 (strength); also Job 40:10 said of men, 2Chr 6:41 (salvation), Ps 132:9 (righteousness), Job 29:14 ( id. ); of Zion Isa 52:1 (twice in verse); also in bad sense, clothed with terror, trembling, shame, etc., Ezek 7:27 ; Ezek 26:16 ; Job 8:22 ; Ps 35:26 ; Ps 109:29 , compare v Ps 35:18 (cursing). \\ \\ c. literally put on , object omitted, נָתַןבֶּ֗֗֗גֶד לִלְבּשׁ Gen 28:20 ; Job 27:17 Infinitive absolute לָבוֺשׁ Hag 1:6 (there is) a clothing , but he has nothing for warmth. \\ \\ d. once with בְּ לְבוּשׁאֲ֗֗֗שֶׁר לָבַשׁ בּוֺ Esth 6:8 . \\ \\ e. Passive participle, clothed with , chiefly Ezek.; — with accusative of garment, Ezek 9:2 ; Ezek 9:3 ; Zech 3:3 ; Prov 31:21 ; Dan 10:5 of wearing armour 1Sam 17:5 construct before garment, לְבֻשׁ הַבַּדִּים Ezek 9:11 ; Ezek 10:2 ; Ezek 10:6 ; Ezek 10:7 , compare Ezek 23:6 ; Ezek 23:12 ; Ezek 38:4 ; Dan 12:6 ; Dan 12:7 . feminine figurative: — לָֽבְשָׁה אֶתגִּֿדְע֑וֺן ׳ וְרוּחַ י Judg 6:34 and the spirit of ׳ י clothed itself with Gideon , i.e. ( GFM ) took possession of him (compare possessed ); so 1Chr 12:18 ; 2Chr 24:20 צֶדֶק לָבַשְׁתִּי וַיִּלְבָּשֵׁנִי Job 29:14 and it clothed itself in me, as it were, became incarnate in me. Pu`al only Participle plural מְלֻבָּשִׁים arrayed , with accusative of garment 1Kgs 22:10 = 2Chr 18:9 ; 2Chr 5:12 absolute in full apparel Ezra 3:10 . Hiph`il Perfect 3 masculine singular suffix הִלְבִּישַׁנִי Isa 61:10 3 feminine singular הִלְבִּישָׁה Gen 27:16 2 masculine singular וְהִלְבַּשְׁתָּ֫ Exod 28:41 + 3 t.; suffix וְהִלְבַּשְׁתָּם (consecutive) Exod 29:8 ; Num 20:26 1 singular suffix וְהִלְבַּשְׁתִּיו Isa 22:21 3 plural הִלְבִּישׁוּ 2Chr 28:15 , וְהִלְבִּשׁוּ (consecutive) Esth 6:9 Imperfect 3 masculine singular וַיַּלְבֵּשׁ Gen 41:42 + 5 t.; suffix וַיַּלְבִּשֵׁם Gen 3:21 ; Lev 8:13 3 feminine singular תַּלְבִּישׁ Prov 23:21 , etc.; Infinitive absolute הַלְבֵּשׁ Zech 3:4 construct הַלְבִּישׁ Esth 4:4 Participle suffix הַמַּלְבִּשְׁכֶם 1Sam 1:24 — clothe, array with . 1. usually with 2 accusative, \\ \\ a. literal וַיּלְבֵּשׁ אֹתוֺ בִּגְדֵישֵֿׁשׁ Gen 41:42 ; 2Sam 1:24 ; Isa 22:21 ; Exod 28:41 ; Exod 29:5 ; Exod 29:8 ; Exod 40:13 ; Exod 40:14 ; Lev 8:7 ; Lev 8:13 ; Num 20:26 ; Num 20:28 ; Zech 3:4 ; Zech 3:5 of clothing Jerusalem under figure of infant Ezek 16:10 of putting armour on some one 1Sam 17:38 (twice in verse). \\ \\ b. figurative, Job 10:11 thou hast clothed me with skin and flesh ; compare Job 39:19 (quivering of horse's neck); Isa 50:3 ; Isa 61:10 ; Ps 132:16 ; Ps 132:18 . 2. with accusative garment only, Gen 27:16 ( + עַליָֿדָיו ); figurative, Prov 23:21 . 3. with accusative of person only, Gen 3:21 ; Gen 27:15 ; 2Chr 28:15 (twice in verse); Esth 4:4 ; Esth 6:9 ; Esth 6:11 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4321')\">BDB4321</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3847')\">H3847</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4320')\">BDB4320</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4322')\">BDB4322</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>לָבֵשׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>לָבַשׁ</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>put on</highlightword> (a garment), <highlightword>wear, clothe, be clothed</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>; Aramaic <bdbarc>לָבֵישׁ</bdbarc>, <placeholder2751/> Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>labâšu</highlight></transliteration>; Arabic <placeholder2752/>; Ethiopic <placeholder2753/>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> Perfect 3 masculine singular<bdbheb>לָבֵשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 93:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"93\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"93\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,93,1)\">Ps 93:1</ref> (twice in verse), <bdbheb>לָבַשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 7:5\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(18,7,5)\">Job 7:5</ref> + 2 t., <bdbheb>וְלָבַשׁ</bdbheb> (consecutive) <ref ref=\"Lev 6:3\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,3)\">Lev 6:3</ref> + 3 t.; suffix <bdbheb>וּלְבָשֵׁם</bdbheb> (consecutive) <ref ref=\"Lev 16:4\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,4)\">Lev 16:4</ref> 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>לָֽבְשָׁה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 6:34\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,34)\">Judg 6:34</ref> + 2 t., etc. (<ref ref=\"Ezek 42:14\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(26,42,14)\">Ezek 42:14</ref> read probably<bdbheb>וְלָֽבְשׁוּ</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup>, for <bdbheb>ילבשׁו</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup>, but clause perhaps interpolated, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup>); <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>יִלְבַּשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 22:5\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(5,22,5)\">Deut 22:5</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>וַיִּלְבָּשֵׁנִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 29:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,29,14)\">Job 29:14</ref> <bdbheb>יִלְבָּשָׁם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 29:30\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,30)\">Exod 29:30</ref> 1 singular suffix <bdbheb>אֶלְבָּשֶׁ֑נָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Song 5:3\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(22,5,3)\">Song 5:3</ref> 3 feminine plural<bdbheb>תִּלְבַּשְׁןָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 13:18\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(10,13,18)\">2Sam 13:18</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Imperative</highlight> masculine singular<bdbheb>לְבַשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:30\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,30)\">1Kgs 22:30</ref>, etc.;<highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight> <bdbheb>לָבוֺשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hag 1:6\" b=\"37\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(37,1,6)\">Hag 1:6</ref> <highlight>construct</highlight> <bdbheb>לִלְבּשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 28:20\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(1,28,20)\">Gen 28:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 21:10\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(3,21,10)\">Lev 21:10</ref> <highlight>Participle active</highlight> plural <bdbheb>הַלֹּבְשִׁים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zeph 1:8\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(36,1,8)\">Zeph 1:8</ref> <highlight>passive</highlight> absolute <bdbheb>לָבוּשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 17:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,17,5)\">1Sam 17:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 10:5\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(27,10,5)\">Dan 10:5</ref> <bdbheb>לָבֻשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 9:2\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(26,9,2)\">Ezek 9:2</ref> + 3 t.; construct <bdbheb>לְבוּשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Dan 12:6\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(27,12,6)\">Dan 12:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 12:7\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(27,12,7)\">Dan 12:7</ref>, <bdbheb>לְבֻשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 9:11\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(26,9,11)\">Ezek 9:11</ref> + 3 t.; plural construct <bdbheb>לְבֻשֵׁי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 23:6\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(26,23,6)\">Ezek 23:6</ref> + 2 t.; — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1. a.</b> literally <highlight> put on </highlight> (one's own) garment (accusative) <ref ref=\"Gen 38:19\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(1,38,19)\">Gen 38:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 28:8\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(9,28,8)\">1Sam 28:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 14:2\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(10,14,2)\">2Sam 14:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:30\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,30)\">1Kgs 22:30</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 18:29\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(14,18,29)\">2Chr 18:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 29:30\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,30)\">Exod 29:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 6:3\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,3)\">Lev 6:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 6:4\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,4)\">Lev 6:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 16:4\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,4)\">Lev 16:4</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Lev 16:23\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,23)\">Lev 16:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 16:24\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,24)\">Lev 16:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 16:32\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,32)\">Lev 16:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 21:10\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(3,21,10)\">Lev 21:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 22:5\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(5,22,5)\">Deut 22:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 44:17\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(26,44,17)\">Ezek 44:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 44:19\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(26,44,19)\">Ezek 44:19</ref>, and so <ref ref=\"Ezek 42:14\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(26,42,14)\">Ezek 42:14</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> (see above), <ref ref=\"Jonah 3:5\" b=\"32\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(32,3,5)\">Jonah 3:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Song 5:3\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(22,5,3)\">Song 5:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 4:1\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(17,4,1)\">Esth 4:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 5:1\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(17,5,1)\">Esth 5:1</ref> with accusative garment + <bdbheb>עַלבְּֿשָׂרוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 16:3\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,3)\">Lev 16:3</ref> of putting on armour <ref ref=\"Jer 46:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,46,4)\">Jer 46:4</ref> = <highlight>wear</highlight> (more or less habitually), with accusative of garment, <ref ref=\"Isa 4:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,4,1)\">Isa 4:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 22:11\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(5,22,11)\">Deut 22:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zeph 1:8\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(36,1,8)\">Zeph 1:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 13:4\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(38,13,4)\">Zech 13:4</ref> of Jerusalem under figure of woman <ref ref=\"Jer 4:30\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(24,4,30)\">Jer 4:30</ref>, of rulers under figure of shepherds <ref ref=\"Ezek 34:3\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(26,34,3)\">Ezek 34:3</ref>, compare <bdbheb>כֵּן תִּלְבַּשְׁןָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 13:18\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(10,13,18)\">2Sam 13:18</ref> (no accusative) <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> very often figurative, <highlight>put on, be clothed with</highlight>, with accusative of garment; — <bdbheb>לָבַשׁ בְּשָׂרִי רִמָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 7:5\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(18,7,5)\">Job 7:5</ref> <highlight>my flesh is clothed</highlight> (i.e. covered) <highlight>with worms</highlight>; of Jerusalem, <highlight>be clothed with</highlight> inhabitants <ref ref=\"Isa 49:18\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(23,49,18)\">Isa 49:18</ref> of pasture, with flocks <ref ref=\"Ps 65:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"65\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"65\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,65,14)\">Ps 65:14</ref> more often the garment is some abstract quality, e.g. righteousness, majesty, beauty, strength, etc.; — <bdbheb>וַיִּלְבַּשׁ צְדָקָה כַּשִּׁרְיָן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 59:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"59\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"59\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,59,17)\">Isa 59:17</ref> he (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>) <highlight>hath put on righteousness as a breastplate</highlight>, compare v<ref ref=\"Isa 59:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"59\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"59\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,59,17)\">Isa 59:17</ref> (vengeance), <ref ref=\"Ps 93:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"93\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"93\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,93,1)\">Ps 93:1</ref> (majesty), v<ref ref=\"Ps 93:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"93\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"93\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,93,1)\">Ps 93:1</ref> (strength), <ref ref=\"Ps 104:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"104\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"104\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,104,1)\">Ps 104:1</ref> (honour and majesty), <ref ref=\"Isa 51:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,51,9)\">Isa 51:9</ref> (strength); also <ref ref=\"Job 40:10\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(18,40,10)\">Job 40:10</ref> said of men, <ref ref=\"2Chr 6:41\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(14,6,41)\">2Chr 6:41</ref> (salvation), <ref ref=\"Ps 132:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"132\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"132\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,132,9)\">Ps 132:9</ref> (righteousness), <ref ref=\"Job 29:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,29,14)\">Job 29:14</ref> (<highlight>id.</highlight>); of Zion <ref ref=\"Isa 52:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,52,1)\">Isa 52:1</ref> (twice in verse); also in bad sense, clothed with terror, trembling, shame, etc., <ref ref=\"Ezek 7:27\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(26,7,27)\">Ezek 7:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 26:16\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(26,26,16)\">Ezek 26:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 8:22\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(18,8,22)\">Job 8:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 35:26\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(19,35,26)\">Ps 35:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 109:29\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"109\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"109\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(19,109,29)\">Ps 109:29</ref>, compare v<ref ref=\"Ps 35:18\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(19,35,18)\">Ps 35:18</ref> (cursing). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> literally <highlight>put on</highlight>, object omitted, <bdbheb>נָתַןבֶּ֗֗֗גֶד לִלְבּשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 28:20\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(1,28,20)\">Gen 28:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 27:17\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(18,27,17)\">Job 27:17</ref> <highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight> <bdbheb>לָבוֺשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hag 1:6\" b=\"37\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(37,1,6)\">Hag 1:6</ref> (there is) <highlight>a clothing</highlight>, but he has nothing for warmth. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> once with <bdbheb>בְּ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>לְבוּשׁאֲ֗֗֗שֶׁר לָבַשׁ בּוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Esth 6:8\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(17,6,8)\">Esth 6:8</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> <highlight>Passive participle, clothed with</highlight>, chiefly Ezek.; — with accusative of garment, <ref ref=\"Ezek 9:2\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(26,9,2)\">Ezek 9:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 9:3\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(26,9,3)\">Ezek 9:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 3:3\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(38,3,3)\">Zech 3:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 31:21\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(20,31,21)\">Prov 31:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 10:5\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(27,10,5)\">Dan 10:5</ref> of wearing armour <ref ref=\"1Sam 17:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,17,5)\">1Sam 17:5</ref> construct before garment, <bdbheb>לְבֻשׁ הַבַּדִּים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 9:11\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(26,9,11)\">Ezek 9:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 10:2\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(26,10,2)\">Ezek 10:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 10:6\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(26,10,6)\">Ezek 10:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 10:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,10,7)\">Ezek 10:7</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Ezek 23:6\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(26,23,6)\">Ezek 23:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 23:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,23,12)\">Ezek 23:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 38:4\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(26,38,4)\">Ezek 38:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 12:6\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(27,12,6)\">Dan 12:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 12:7\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(27,12,7)\">Dan 12:7</ref>. <b>feminine</b> <highlightword>figurative:</highlightword> — <bdbheb>לָֽבְשָׁה אֶתגִּֿדְע֑וֺן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וְרוּחַ י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 6:34\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,34)\">Judg 6:34</ref> <highlight>and the spirit of</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <highlight>clothed itself with Gideon</highlight>, i.e. (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('GFM')\">GFM</lookup>) took possession of him (compare <placeholder2754/> <highlight>possessed</highlight>); so <ref ref=\"1Chr 12:18\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,18)\">1Chr 12:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 24:20\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(14,24,20)\">2Chr 24:20</ref> <bdbheb>צֶדֶק לָבַשְׁתִּי וַיִּלְבָּשֵׁנִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 29:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,29,14)\">Job 29:14</ref> and it <highlight>clothed itself</highlight> in me, as it were, became incarnate in me. <b>Pu`al</b> only <highlight>Participle</highlight> plural <bdbheb>מְלֻבָּשִׁים</bdbheb> <highlight>arrayed</highlight>, with accusative of garment <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:10\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,10)\">1Kgs 22:10</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 18:9\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(14,18,9)\">2Chr 18:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 5:12\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(14,5,12)\">2Chr 5:12</ref> absolute <highlight>in full apparel</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ezra 3:10\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(15,3,10)\">Ezra 3:10</ref>. <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular suffix <bdbheb>הִלְבִּישַׁנִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 61:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"61\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"61\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,61,10)\">Isa 61:10</ref> 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>הִלְבִּישָׁה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 27:16\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(1,27,16)\">Gen 27:16</ref> 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>וְהִלְבַּשְׁתָּ֫</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 28:41\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(2,28,41)\">Exod 28:41</ref> + 3 t.; suffix <bdbheb>וְהִלְבַּשְׁתָּם</bdbheb> (consecutive) <ref ref=\"Exod 29:8\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,8)\">Exod 29:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 20:26\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(4,20,26)\">Num 20:26</ref> 1 singular suffix <bdbheb>וְהִלְבַּשְׁתִּיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 22:21\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(23,22,21)\">Isa 22:21</ref> 3 plural <bdbheb>הִלְבִּישׁוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 28:15\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(14,28,15)\">2Chr 28:15</ref>, <bdbheb>וְהִלְבִּשׁוּ</bdbheb> (consecutive) <ref ref=\"Esth 6:9\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(17,6,9)\">Esth 6:9</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>וַיַּלְבֵּשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 41:42\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"42\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"42\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,42)\">Gen 41:42</ref> + 5 t.; suffix <bdbheb>וַיַּלְבִּשֵׁם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 3:21\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(1,3,21)\">Gen 3:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 8:13\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(3,8,13)\">Lev 8:13</ref> 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>תַּלְבִּישׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 23:21\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(20,23,21)\">Prov 23:21</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight> <bdbheb>הַלְבֵּשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zech 3:4\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(38,3,4)\">Zech 3:4</ref> construct <bdbheb>הַלְבִּישׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Esth 4:4\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(17,4,4)\">Esth 4:4</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> suffix <bdbheb>הַמַּלְבִּשְׁכֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 1:24\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(9,1,24)\">1Sam 1:24</ref> — <highlight>clothe, array with</highlight>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> usually with 2 accusative, <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> literal <bdbheb>וַיּלְבֵּשׁ אֹתוֺ בִּגְדֵישֵֿׁשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 41:42\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"42\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"42\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,42)\">Gen 41:42</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 1:24\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(10,1,24)\">2Sam 1:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 22:21\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(23,22,21)\">Isa 22:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 28:41\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(2,28,41)\">Exod 28:41</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 29:5\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,5)\">Exod 29:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 29:8\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,8)\">Exod 29:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 40:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,40,13)\">Exod 40:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 40:14\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(2,40,14)\">Exod 40:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 8:7\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(3,8,7)\">Lev 8:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 8:13\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(3,8,13)\">Lev 8:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 20:26\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(4,20,26)\">Num 20:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 20:28\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(4,20,28)\">Num 20:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 3:4\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(38,3,4)\">Zech 3:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 3:5\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(38,3,5)\">Zech 3:5</ref> of clothing Jerusalem under figure of infant <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:10\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,10)\">Ezek 16:10</ref> of putting armour on some one <ref ref=\"1Sam 17:38\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(9,17,38)\">1Sam 17:38</ref> (twice in verse). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> figurative, <ref ref=\"Job 10:11\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(18,10,11)\">Job 10:11</ref> <highlight>thou hast clothed me with skin and flesh</highlight>; compare <ref ref=\"Job 39:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,39,19)\">Job 39:19</ref> (quivering of horse's neck); <ref ref=\"Isa 50:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,50,3)\">Isa 50:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 61:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"61\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"61\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,61,10)\">Isa 61:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 132:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"132\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"132\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,132,16)\">Ps 132:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 132:18\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"132\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"132\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(19,132,18)\">Ps 132:18</re